return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);','language'=>'sr_RS','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:25:23+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-09T22:25:23+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Pakuje ovaj WordPress sajt — fajlove i bazu podataka — u jednu arhivu koju Zinn Digital® može da preuzme, za hostove do kojih ne možemo da dođemo na drugi način. Instalirajte ga na sajtu sa kog ODLAZITE, pritisnite jedno dugme i nalepite link u svoju Zinn® migraciju.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'Premestite ovaj sajt na Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'Prebaci na Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Nemate dozvolu za ovo.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Ovo pakuje sve na ovom sajtu – njegove fajlove i bazu podataka – u jednu arhivu i daje vam privatni link do nje. Nalepite taj link u svoju migraciju na Zinn® i mi ćemo prebaciti sajt. Ovde se ništa nigde ne šalje dok ne odlučite da podelite link.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Možda vam ovo nije potrebno. Ako vam vaš stari host pruža FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk ili DirectAdmin, Zinn® može direktno da preuzme sajt pomoću tih podataka i možete u potpunosti preskočiti ovaj dodatak — brže je i posle toga ništa nije ostalo. Koristite ovo kada vam ništa od toga nije dostupno.','Room on this server'=>'Prostor na ovom serveru','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Ovaj server nam ne govori koliko je slobodnog prostora na disku preostalo, tako da ne možemo da proverimo umesto vas. Paketu je potrebno otprilike %s. Ako niste sigurni da ima toliko mesta, pitajte svog hosting provajdera pre nego što ga napravite — server kojem ponestane prostora usred procesa oboriće sajt.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Paketu je potrebno otprilike %1$s, a ovaj server ima %2$s slobodnog prostora.','Build the package'=>'Napravi paket','Building…'=>'Izrada u toku…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Sada se pakuje: %1$s. Do sada %2$s datoteka, %3$s zapisanih.','your files'=>'vaše datoteke','your database'=>'vaša baza podataka','Continue'=>'Nastavi','Cancel and delete'=>'Otkaži i obriši','Your package is ready'=>'Ваш пакет је спреман','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Kopirajte ovu vezu i nalepite je u svoju migraciju na platformi Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Veličina: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Tretirajte ovaj link kao lozinku. Bilo ko ko ga ima može da preuzme ceo vaš sajt, uključujući i bazu podataka. Paket brišemo automatski 24 sata nakon što je napravljen — obrišite ga sami čim se migracija završi.','Delete the package now'=>'Izbriši paket odmah','Build it again'=>'Izgradite ponovo','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Ovaj server nema PHP ekstenziju ZipArchive, tako da ovde ne možemo da napravite paket. Zatražite od svog provajdera da je omogući ili umesto toga koristite formular za migraciju na platformi Zinn® sa svojim FTP ili SSH podacima.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Nismo mogli da kreiramo fasciklu unutar vašeg direktorijuma za otpremanje, tako da nema gde da se upiše paket. Proverite da li je wp-content/uploads upisiv.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Trenutno se nijedan paket ne gradi. Prvo pokrenite jedan.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Nismo mogli da otvorimo fajl paketa za upis.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Nismo mogli da sačuvamo izvoz baze podataka.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — vodiči i usluge','User guides'=>'Korisnička uputstva','Read the %s user guide'=>'Pročitajte %s korisničko uputstvo','Hide this'=>'Sakrij ovo','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting za WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, dnevne rezervne kopije, besplatna migracija i kontrolna tabla napravljena za ljude koji vode više od jednog sajta.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® tržište','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Kupujte i prodajite već uspostavljene sajtove, domene i postavljanja linkova, pri čemu se novac čuva na sigurnom dok obe strane ne budu zadovoljne.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — angažujte ljude koji se time bave profesionalno','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Naše globalno tržište honorarnih poslova: pregledajte preko 10.000 gotovih usluga pisaca, dizajnera, programera i SEO stručnjaka, ili objavite projekat i dozvolite im da licitiraju.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Pogledajte napomene o izdanju za Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Preuzeto ažuriranje nije prošlo proveru integriteta i nije instalirano.']];